# Decouple installation

## Requirement

Ensure setup/integration deployment can be owned by `iasi-setup-platform` without requiring it to own plugin code.

## Traceability

- `inputs/externals/objectives.md` · Specific objectives 10
- `inputs/externals/definitions.md` · 2. Related responsibilities

## Verification

Verify the stated behavior through a focused acceptance test or documented inspection. Detailed test cases will be defined during design.
